    "chunk_text": "fene. \u00dea agunnon \u00feencan \u00fea boceras & Farisei & cw\u00e6don, hw\u00e6t is \u00fees \u00fee her spryc\u00fe woffunga; Hwa m\u00e6g \u00d0a se h\u00e6lend gecneow hyra ge\u00feancas he andswariende cw\u00e6\u00fe to him, hw\u00e6t \u00feence ge on eowrum & he sona beforan him aras, & nam \u00fe\u00e6t he on l\u00e6g & to his huse ferde & God wuldrode. & hig ealle wundredon & God m\u00e6rsodon & w\u00e6ron mid ege gefyllede, & cw\u00e6don, so\u00f0es we tod\u00e6g \u00dea \u00e6fter \u00feam he uteode & geseah Publicanum, he w\u00e6s o\u00ferum naman Leui gehaten \u00e6t ceapsceamule & he him \u00fea filigde & ealle hys \u00feing forlet. & Leui dyde him mycelne gebeorscype on his huse, & \u00fear w\u00e6s mycel menegeo manfulra & o\u00f0erra \u00fee \u00dea murcnodon \u00fea Farisei & \u00fea boceras & cw\u00e6don to hys leorningcnihtum, hwi ete ge & drinca\u00f0 mid \u00d0a andswarude se H\u00e6lend & cw\u00e6\u00fe to him, Ne be\u00feurfon l\u00e6ces \u00fea \u00f0e hale synd, ac \u00fea \u00f0e unh\u00e6l\u00fee Ne com ic rihtwise clypian, ac synfulle on d\u00e6dbote. \u00d0a cw\u00e6don hig to him, hwi f\u00e6sta\u00f0 Iohannes leorningcnihtas gelomlice & halsunga do\u00f0, & eallswa \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 he, cwystu\u00feu magon \u00fe\u00e6s brydguman bearn f\u00e6stan swa lange swa se brydguma myd him ys. So\u00felice \u00fea dagas cuma\u00fe \u00feonne se brydguma him by\u00f0 af",
